{"kind": "mod", "id": 2016, "name": "Delayed Flea Sales", "slug": "delayed-flea-sales", "teaser": "If you are tired of having your flea offers being sold instantly, maybe you don't like money - I don't know, this mod is for you.", "owner_name": "acidphantasm", "downloads": 4954, "favourites": 6, "featured": false, "contains_ads": false, "contains_ai_content": false, "cheat_notice": false, "license_name": null, "guid": "com.acidphantasm.delayedfleasales", "thumbnail_local": null, "category": "Other", "category_id": 17, "updated_at": "2026-08-07T06:02:14.000000Z", "created_at": "2025-02-22T06:48:17.000000Z", "published_at": "2025-02-22T06:48:00.000000Z", "latest_constraint": "~4.1", "latest_version": "2.1.0", "has_local": false, "has_github": false, "license_link": null, "description_html": "<p>Very simply allows configurable delayed sales for flea offers. If you don’t want instant sales when you sell at average price or lower, then use this mod.</p>\n<p>Adjust the instant sell chance, minimum delayed sale time, and maximum delayed sale time.</p>\n<p>If you don’t want instant sales at all, change that in the config to 0.</p>\n<p>If an offer is marked to sell before the minimum delayed sale time, then it will roll a random time between the minimum and maximum.</p>\n<p><strong>Default Values</strong></p>\n<p>Instant Sell Chance: 25%</p>\n<p>Minimum Sale Time: 60 seconds</p>\n<p>Maximum Sale Time: 900 seconds</p>\n<div class=\"tabset\"><div id=\"tabset-1-panel-1\" class=\"tab-panel\"><div class=\"tab-title\">Installation</div>\n<div class=\"tab-content\"><hr />\n<ol>\n<li>Download Delayed Flea Sales</li>\n<li>Open the downloaded zip file</li>\n<li>Select the SPT folder in the zip file</li>\n<li>Drag the SPT folder from zip file into your root SPT folder</li>\n</ol>\n<p>Demonstration Video (yoink):</p>\n<p><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/34vXXDj.gif\" alt=\"34vXXDj.gif\" /></p></div></div>\n<div id=\"tabset-1-panel-2\" class=\"tab-panel\"><div class=\"tab-title\">UNINSTALLATION</div>\n<div class=\"tab-content\"><hr />\n<ol>\n<li>Delete <code>/ROOTSPT/SPT/user/mods/acidphantasm-delayedfleasales</code></li>\n<li>Done</li>\n</ol></div></div></div>\n<p>If you enjoy my work - you can <a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://ko-fi.com/acidphantasm\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">buy me a coffee</a>~</p>\n", "versions": [{"version": "1.0.0", "spt_version_constraint": "~3.10.0", "content_length": null, "downloads": 528, "published_at": "2025-02-22T06:48:17.000000Z", "forge_link": "https://forge.sp-tarkov.com/mod/download/2016/delayed-flea-sales/1.0.0", "github_url": null, "external_url": null, "local_path": null, "fika_compatibility": "unknown", "dependencies": []}, {"version": "1.1.0", "spt_version_constraint": "~3.11.0", "content_length": null, "downloads": 1409, "published_at": "2025-03-15T20:26:19.000000Z", "forge_link": "https://forge.sp-tarkov.com/mod/download/2016/delayed-flea-sales/1.1.0", "github_url": null, "external_url": null, "local_path": null, "fika_compatibility": "unknown", "dependencies": []}, {"version": "2.0.0", "spt_version_constraint": "~4.0.0", "content_length": 5146, "downloads": 1212, "published_at": "2025-10-11T21:44:00.000000Z", "forge_link": "https://forge.sp-tarkov.com/mod/download/2016/delayed-flea-sales/2.0.0", "github_url": null, "external_url": null, "local_path": null, "fika_compatibility": "compatible", "dependencies": []}, {"version": "2.0.1", "spt_version_constraint": "~4.0.11", "content_length": 5426, "downloads": 1593, "published_at": "2026-01-05T05:41:00.000000Z", "forge_link": "https://forge.sp-tarkov.com/mod/download/2016/delayed-flea-sales/2.0.1", "github_url": null, "external_url": null, "local_path": null, "fika_compatibility": "compatible", "dependencies": []}, {"version": "2.1.0", "spt_version_constraint": "~4.1", "content_length": 9092, "downloads": 212, "published_at": "2026-08-06T23:33:00.000000Z", "forge_link": "https://forge.sp-tarkov.com